<title>USA: Owens Corning Q4 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Owens Corning Q4 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>TOLEDO, Ohio 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr prim profit $1.32	  profit  $1.27</p>
<p> Shr dil  profit 1.25	   profit  1.21</p>
<p> Net	profit 70,000	 profit  66,000</p>
<p> Sales	     1,002,000		964,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary52,700		   51,800</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted57,300		   56,400</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr primary loss$5.50	  profit  $4.64</p>
<p> Shr diluted loss5.50	   profit  4.40</p>
<p> Net	   loss284,000	profit  231,000</p>
<p> Sales	     3,832,000		3,612,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary51,700		   49,700</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted51,700		   54,100</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q4 1996 includes $43 million pretax restructuring charge, Q4 1995 includes $0.15 per share tax-loss benefit. 1996 results also include $542 million charge for asbestos and 1995 results include $0.15 per share gain.</p>
</text>
